gate: OPEN
v:4 role:qa x:mobile
task: S89 T9 — Device check of the client bug list
requires: [QA, FRONTEND_DEV]
sprint: S89

context: |
  Confirm the client list on a Tauri device build after T1–T8.
  History selection stays on the last segment (S87). Clustering stays
  on below max zoom (S73).

steps:
  1. Events: set speeding to a non-130 value, Apply, reopen. Value matches.
     Turn a toggle off, reopen. Server state matches. Force a failed save
     and confirm the toast.
  2. Build a track, zoom in, pan. Arrows follow the visible direction.
  3. Open History and switch dates. First row is 00:00 when the API start
     is before that day. Highlight stays on the last segment.
  4. Enable grouping, zoom to max on two vehicles at one point. Markers
     separate. Zoom out. They cluster again.
  5. Speeding push in uk or en shows four lines and the speed number.
     Tap opens the map popup on that event. A push arriving in foreground
     does not navigate.
  6. Open a vehicle popup that has CAN keys. Rows are visible. Record
     the T8 stop report if the sample vehicle has none.

out:
  - sprints/89/report.ti

done:
  - Each step above is marked pass or fail in report.ti.
  - No application source is changed in this task.
